# SPA fallback for BiteCare (React Router).
#
# Cloudflare Pages serves the app root for any path that does not match a
# static asset whenever the project has no top-level 404.html file, which is
# the case here. That is the SPA fallback, so no redirect rule is required.
#
# Do NOT add "/* /index.html 200" here. Cloudflare normalises .html URLs
# (/index.html -> /index -> /), so that rule re-matches itself and is rejected
# as an infinite loop (error 100324).
